<title>CHINA: CITIBANK SETS CHEUNG KONG, HONGKONG LAND WARRANTS.</title>
<headline>CITIBANK SETS CHEUNG KONG, HONGKONG LAND WARRANTS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. Hong Kong Branch said on Thursday it launched 388 million American style call warrants on a basket of two property stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Hongkong Land				 0.06 shares</p>
<p> Cheung Kong Holdings Ltd		  0.04 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$5.459	   PREMIUM	 13.95 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.131	   GEARING	 4.17X</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT   HK$5.459	   MATURITY	05.JUN.98</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG	  LISTING DATE  28.AUG.97</p>
<p> LOT SIZE	   10,000</p>
<p> NOTE		 WITH ISSUER'S CASH OPTION</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
